00:30:11.440 --> 00:30:14.560
Think I included this here.
Yeah, okay Watch these all of

00:30:14.560 --> 00:30:17.060
these data sets have those same
five quantities in common

00:30:17.060 --> 00:30:20.380
Average X average Y X standard
deviation Y standard deviation

00:30:20.380 --> 00:30:23.240
and correlation including one
that looks like a dinosaur

00:30:23.240 --> 00:30:24.240
OK?

00:30:24.320 --> 00:30:28.020
All of these share those same
five properties, so they all

00:30:28.020 --> 00:30:29.440
have the same line of best fit.

00:30:29.440 --> 00:30:33.100
And so my bigger picture here is
I don't rely just on numbers to

