00:42:19.840 --> 00:42:21.720
plug in your data set, and it
will tell you what they're

00:42:21.720 --> 00:42:23.700
supposed to be.
I don't care how many features

00:42:23.700 --> 00:42:25.200
you have.

00:42:25.480 --> 00:42:28.480
And linear algebra will be the
tool that gets us there.

00:42:28.480 --> 00:42:30.140
The short answer is,

